#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Fikirana ankapobeny"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Service Check Name"
msgstr "Anaran'ny fanamarinana tolotra"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The name that is displayed for this Service Check, and is included in any Alert notifications."
msgstr "Ny anarana aseho ho an'ity Fanamarinana Serivisy ity, ary ampidirina ao amin'ny fampandrenesana Fanairana rehetra."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many attempts"
msgstr "Impiry no manandrana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Cacti attempts to run each test multiple times. The first successful attempt ends the testing and records the success. If none of the attempts are successful, the test is terminated and a failure is recorded. High number causes log test duration."
msgstr "Miezaka manatanteraka ny fitsapana tsirairay imbetsaka i Cacti. Ny andrana voalohany mahomby dia mamarana ny fitsapana ary mirakitra ny fahombiazana. Raha tsy misy mahomby amin'ireo andrana ireo, dia atsahatra ny fitsapana ary voarakitra ny tsy fahombiazana. Ny isa avo dia mahatonga ny faharetan'ny fitsapana ho lava."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable test"
msgstr "Ataovy mavitrika ny fitsapana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Uncheck this box to disable this test from being checked."
msgstr "Esory ny marika amin'ity boaty ity mba tsy ho voamarina intsony ity fitsapana ity."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable run script for this test"
msgstr "Ataovy mavitrika ny fandefasana script ho an'ity fitsapana ity"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If the global Command Execution function is enabled, you can set here whether the script should be run for this test or not."
msgstr "Raha mavitrika ny fiasan'ny Fanatanterahana Baiko manontolo, dia azonao faritana eto raha tokony halefa ho an'ity fitsapana ity ny script na tsia."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Poller"
msgstr "Poller"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Poller on which the test will run"
msgstr "Poller izay handehan'ny fitsapana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Type of service"
msgstr "Karazana serivisy"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "What type of service?"
msgstr "Karazana serivisy manao ahoana?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "IP Address or DNS name of server"
msgstr "Adiresy IP na anarana DNS an'ny lohamilina"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "You can specify another port (example.com:5000) otherwise default will be used. For IPv6 numeric address use [ip:ad:dr:es:fo:rma:at]. For DOH (DNS over HTTPS) use here name of server (example 10.10.10.10, cloudflare-dns.com, ..)"
msgstr "Afaka mamaritra seranana hafa ianao (example.com:5000) fa raha tsy izany dia ny mahazatra no hampiasaina. Ho an'ny adiresy isa IPv6 dia ampiasao ny [ip:ad:dr:es:fo:rma:at]. Ho an'ny DOH (DNS over HTTPS) dia ampiasao eto ny anaran'ny mpizara (ohatra 10.10.10.10, cloudflare-dns.com, ..)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Resolve DNS to Address"
msgstr "Avadiho ho adiresy ny DNS"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enter an IP Address to force DNS name to resolve to. Leaving blank will use DNS Resolution instead."
msgstr "Ampidiro Adiresy IP hanerena ny famahana ny anarana DNS. Raha avela ho banga dia ny Famahana DNS no hampiasaina."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Service settings"
msgstr "Fandrindrana ny tolotra"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Select correct credential"
msgstr "Misafidiana mari-pamantarana marina"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP OID"
msgstr "OID SNMP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Insert SNMP OID"
msgstr "Ampidiro ny SNMP OID"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSH command"
msgstr "Baiko SSH"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Insert SSH command with full path, result of command will be returned"
msgstr "Ampidiro ny baiko SSH miaraka amin'ny lalana feno, haverina ny vokatry ny baiko"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Your own CA and intermediate certs"
msgstr "Ny CA-nao manokana sy ireo taratasy fanamarinana mpanelanelana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP Search"
msgstr "Fikarohana LDAP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP search filter, it could be ,OU=anygroup,DC=example,DC=com"
msgstr "Sivana fikarohana LDAP, mety ho ,OU=anygroup,DC=example,DC=com"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "DNS Name for Query"
msgstr "Anarana DNS ho an'ny fangatahana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "DNS name for querying. For DOH (DNS over HTTPS) use /resolve?name=example.com or /dns-query?name=example.com&type=A. For plaintext DNS A and AAAA records will be returned"
msgstr "Anarana DNS hanaovana fangatahana. Ho an'ny DOH (DNS ambonin'ny HTTPS) ampiasao ny /resolve?name=example.com na /dns-query?name=example.com&type=A. Ho an'ny soratra tsotra dia haverina ny firaketana DNS A sy AAAA"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Path Part of URL"
msgstr "Ampahan-dalana ao amin'ny URL"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For web service insert at least \"/\" or something like \"/any/path/\"."
msgstr "Ho an'ny serivisy tranonkala dia ampidiro farafahakeliny \"/\" na zavatra toy ny \"/lalana/rehetra/\"."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Requires Authentication"
msgstr "Mitaky fanamarinana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check this box if the site will normally return a 401 Error as it requires a username and password."
msgstr "Mariho ity boaty ity raha mamerina hadisoana 401 matetika ny toerana satria mitaky anaran'ny mpampiasa sy tenimiafina."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Proxy Server"
msgstr "Mpizara mpanelanelana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If this connection text requires a proxy, select it here.  Otherwise choose 'None'."
msgstr "Raha mitaky proxy ity lahatsoratra fifandraisana ity, dia fidio eto izany. Raha tsy izany, fidio ny 'Tsy misy'."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check Certificate"
msgstr "Hamarino ny taratasy fanamarinana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If using SSL, check this box if you want to validate the certificate. Default on, turn off if you the site uses a self-signed certificate."
msgstr "Raha mampiasa SSL, mariho ity boaty ity raha te hanamarina ny mari-pankatoavana ianao. Mandeha amin'ny fomba mahazatra, vonoy raha mampiasa mari-pankatoavana nosoniaviny manokana ny toerana."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check and notify Certificate expiration"
msgstr "Hamarino ary ampandre ny fahataperan'ny taratasy fanamarinana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If using SSL, check this box if you want to check the certificate expiration. You can set in settings how many days before expiration notify.."
msgstr "Raha mampiasa SSL, mariho ity boaty ity raha te hanamarina ny fahataperan'ny mari-pankatoavana ianao. Azonao faritana ao amin'ny fandrindrana hoe firy andro mialoha ny fahataperana no hampahafantarina."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Masontsivana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How Often to Test"
msgstr "Impiry no hitsapa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Test every xth poller run"
msgstr "Andramana isaky ny fandehanan'ny poller faha-x"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Trigger"
msgstr "Mpandrisika"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many times the service must be DOWN before an alert email is triggered."
msgstr "Impiry no tsy maintsy ho MATY ny serivisy alohan'ny handefasana mailaka fanairana."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Long duration alert"
msgstr "Fanairana faharetana lava"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If the test time is greater than this value more times in a row, send a notification. Related to variable Duration count. The test inherits the maximum runtime from the settings. If a higher value is set here, the maximum runtime is this value + 2 seconds."
msgstr "Raha mihoatra an'io sanda io ny fotoanan'ny fitsapana imbetsaka misesy, dia mandefasa fampahafantarana. Mifandraika amin'ny variable fanisana Faharetana. Mandova ny fotoana fiasana farany ambony avy amin'ny fandrindrana ny fitsapana. Raha sanda ambony kokoa no apetraka eto, ny fotoana fiasana farany ambony dia io sanda io + 2 segondra."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Number of duration violations in a row"
msgstr "Isan'ny fandikana faharetana mifanesy"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many times the duration trigger must be exceeded in a row for a notification to be sent"
msgstr "Impiry misesy no tsy maintsy mihoatra ny fetran'ny faharetana alohan'ny handefasana fampandrenesana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Verification Strings"
msgstr "Teny fanamarinana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Response Search String"
msgstr "Teny fikarohana amin'ny valiny"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the string to search for in the response for a live and working service."
msgstr "Ity no laha-tsoratra karohina ao amin'ny valinteny ho an'ny sampan-draharaha velona sy miasa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Response Search String - Maintenance"
msgstr "Teny fikarohana amin'ny valiny - Fikojakojana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the string to search for on the Maintenance .  The Service Check will check for this string if the above string is not found.  If found, it means that the service is under maintenance."
msgstr "Ity no laha-tsoratra karohina ao amin'ny Fikojakojana. Hanamarina ity laha-tsoratra ity ny Fanamarinana Sampan-draharaha raha tsy hita ilay laha-tsoratra etsy ambony. Raha hita izany dia midika fa eo am-pikojakojana ilay sampan-draharaha."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Response Search String - Failed"
msgstr "Teny fikarohana amin'ny valiny - Tsy nahomby"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the string to search for a known failure in the service response.  The Service Check will only alert if this string is found, ignoring any timeout issues and the search strings above."
