#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "<b>Can be used for a lot of service checks:</b><br/><i>Http/https</i> - optional, when it is set, try HTTP basic auth<br/><i>SMTP on port 587</i> - optional. Without a username/password, only the server response is tested. With a username and password, login is also performed<br/><i>Imap, imaps, pop3, pop3s, ftp</i> - optional. For anonymous ftp, use username \"anonymous\" and email address as password<br/><i>LDAP, smb, smbs</i> - required<br/><i>MQTT</i> - optional<br/><i>SCP, SSH command</i> - you can use this method or private key method"
msgstr "<b>Azo ampiasaina amin'ny fanamarinana serivisy maro:</b><br/><i>Http/https</i> - tsy voatery, rehefa voafaritra izy dia manandrana fanamarinana fototra HTTP<br/><i>SMTP eo amin'ny seranana 587</i> - tsy voatery. Raha tsy misy anaran'ny mpampiasa/tenimiafina, dia ny valintenin'ny lohamilina ihany no tsapaina. Raha misy anaran'ny mpampiasa sy tenimiafina dia atao ihany koa ny fidirana<br/><i>Imap, imaps, pop3, pop3s, ftp</i> - tsy voatery. Ho an'ny ftp tsy mitonona anarana, ampiasao ny anaran'ny mpampiasa \"anonymous\" ary adiresy mailaka ho tenimiafina<br/><i>LDAP, smb, smbs</i> - takiana<br/><i>MQTT</i> - tsy voatery<br/><i>Baiko SCP, SSH</i> - azonao ampiasaina ity fomba ity na ny fomba fanalahidy manokana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - Basic HTTP auth. Username and password are required"
msgstr "Rest API - Fanamarinana HTTP tsotra. Ilaina ny anaran'ny mpampiasa sy ny tenimiafina"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - API key auth<br/>Auth is sent in HTTP header, custom header or POST method. Credentials in URL are not supported.<br/>Insert API key name and value. Both values are required. For HTTP header the name <i>Bearer or apikey or \"\"</i> is usually used (Authorization: Bearer apivalue). For custom header <i>X-API-Key</i> is usually used (X-Api-Key: keyvalue). For POST <i>api_key</i> is usually used."
msgstr "Rest API - Fanamarinana amin'ny fanalahidin'ny API<br/>Alefa amin'ny lohateny HTTP, lohateny manokana na fomba POST ny fanamarinana. Tsy tohana ny mari-pamantarana ao amin'ny URL.<br/>Ampidiro ny anarana sy ny sandan'ny fanalahidin'ny API. Ilaina avokoa ny sanda roa. Ho an'ny lohateny HTTP, ny anarana <i>Bearer na apikey na \"\"</i> no matetika ampiasaina (Authorization: Bearer apivalue). Ho an'ny lohateny manokana, <i>X-API-Key</i> no matetika ampiasaina (X-Api-Key: keyvalue). Ho an'ny POST, <i>api_key</i> no matetika ampiasaina."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - OAuth2/Bearer token auth<br/>You can have key/token from server and insert it here or use auth flow with credentials. Username and password are sent Json encoded."
msgstr "Rest API - Fanamarinana amin'ny mari-pamantarana OAuth2/Bearer<br/>Afaka maka fanalahidy/mari-pamantarana avy amin'ny mpizara ianao ka mampiditra izany eto, na mampiasa dingana fanamarinana miaraka amin'ny mombamomba ny fidirana. Alefa amin'ny endrika JSON ny anaran'ny mpampiasa sy ny tenimiafina."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - Cookie based auth - both values are required. After login, cookie is returned"
msgstr "Rest API - Fanamarinana mifototra amin'ny Cookie - ilaina avokoa ny sanda roa. Rehefa tafiditra dia averina ny cookie"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP v1 or v2 - required, insert community name here"
msgstr "SNMP v1 na v2 - takiana, ampidiro eto ny anaran'ny fiaraha-monina"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP v3 - The security level determines which parameters are required"
msgstr "SNMP v3 - Ny haavon'ny fiarovana no mamaritra izay mason-tsivana takiana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSH private key - Can be used for SCP or SSH command test. These test can use username/password too"
msgstr "Fanalahidy manokana SSH - Azo ampiasaina amin'ny fanandramana baiko SCP na SSH. Ireo fanandramana ireo dia afaka mampiasa anaran'ny mpampiasa/tenimiafina ihany koa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "It only checks whether the web server is responding. If username/password credential is used, it will try Basic HTTP auth."
msgstr "Izany dia manamarina fotsiny raha mamaly ny mpizara tranonkala. Raha ampiasaina ny anaran'ny mpampiasa/tenimiafina, dia hanandrana fanamarinana Basic HTTP izy."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The same as HTTP plaintext but adds the ability to test certificates."
msgstr "Mitovy amin'ny HTTP lahatsoratra tsotra fa manampy fahafahana mitsapa taratasy fanamarinana."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "It only checks whether the SMTP server is responding. No authentication. You will see server login banner and ehlo response."
msgstr "Izany dia manamarina fotsiny raha mamaly ny mpizara SMTP. Tsy misy fanamarinana maha-izy azy. Ho hitanao ny sora-baventy fidirana amin'ny mpizara sy ny valiny ehlo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted + STARTTLS. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate. Without username and password, you will see server login banner and ehlo response. With credential, login will be performed"
msgstr "Tsy voarakotra + STARTTLS. Azo atao ihany koa ny mitsapa ny fahamarinan'ny taratasy fanamarinana. Raha tsy misy anaran'ny mpampiasa sy tenimiafina dia ho hitanao ny sora-baventy fidirana amin'ny mpizara sy ny valin'ny ehlo. Raha misy fanomezan-dàlana dia hatao ny fidirana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted connection on default port 465. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate. With username and password AUTH LOGIN will be tested."
msgstr "Fifandraisana voaaro amin'ny fanafenana amin'ny seranana mahazatra 465. Azo tsapaina ihany koa ny fananan-kerin'ny mari-pankatoavana. Miaraka amin'ny anaran'ny mpampiasa sy tenimiafina dia hotsapaina ny AUTH LOGIN."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted IMAP connection. Without credential, only connection will be tested. You will see only login banner. With credential login will be tested and try to read list of messages. You can use AUTHENTICATE PLAIN or AUTHENTICATE LOGIN method."
msgstr "Fifandraisana IMAP tsy voarakotra. Raha tsy misy fanomezan-dàlana dia ny fifandraisana ihany no hotsapaina. Ny sora-baventy fidirana ihany no ho hitanao. Raha misy fanomezan-dàlana dia hotsapaina ny fidirana ary hanandrana hamaky ny lisitry ny hafatra. Azonao ampiasaina ny fomba AUTHENTICATE PLAIN na AUTHENTICATE LOGIN."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The same as unencrypted IMAP but after login STARTTLS is used. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate after STARTTLS."
msgstr "Mitovy amin'ny IMAP tsy voasoratra miafina fa aorian'ny fidirana dia mampiasa STARTTLS. Azo atao ihany koa ny mitsapa ny maha-ara-dalàna ny taratasy fanamarinana aorian'ny STARTTLS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted IMAP, you can try login and test certificate and user login"
msgstr "IMAP voaaro amin'ny fanafenana, afaka manandrana miditra ianao ary mitsapa ny mari-pankatoavana sy ny fidirana ho an'ny mpampiasa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted POP3 connection. Without credential, only connection will be tested. You will see only login banner. With credential login will be tested and try to read list of messages"
msgstr "Fifandraisana POP3 tsy voarakotra. Raha tsy misy fanomezan-dàlana dia ny fifandraisana ihany no hotsapaina. Ny sora-baventy fidirana ihany no ho hitanao. Raha misy fanomezan-dàlana dia hotsapaina ny fidirana ary hanandrana hamaky ny lisitry ny hafatra"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The same as unencrypted POP3 but after login STARTTLS is used. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate after STARTTLS."
msgstr "Mitovy amin'ny POP3 tsy voasoratra miafina fa aorian'ny fidirana dia mampiasa STARTTLS. Azo atao ihany koa ny mitsapa ny maha-ara-dalàna ny taratasy fanamarinana aorian'ny STARTTLS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted POP3, you can try login and test certificate and user login."
msgstr "POP3 voaaro amin'ny fanafenana, afaka manandrana miditra ianao ary mitsapa ny mari-pankatoavana sy ny fidirana ho an'ny mpampiasa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try to resolve DNS record on specified DNS server"
msgstr "Andramo ny mamaha ny firaketana DNS eo amin'ny mpizara DNS voafaritra"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try DNS over HTTPS."
msgstr "Andramo ny DNS amin'ny HTTPS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "All parameters are required. Perform unencrypted LDAP login and search"
msgstr "Ilaina avokoa ny mason-tsivana rehetra. Manaova fidirana sy fikarohana LDAP tsy voaaro amin'ny fanafenana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "All parameters are required. Perform encrypted LDAP login and search"
msgstr "Ilaina avokoa ny mason-tsivana rehetra. Manaova fidirana sy fikarohana LDAP voaaro amin'ny fanafenana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted FTP connection, login and try to download file specified in path (/path/to/file.txt). For anonymous connection use login *anonymous* and email address as password. The content of the file is returned."
msgstr "Fifandraisana FTP tsy voarakotra, midira ary manandrama mampidina ny rakitra voafaritra ao amin'ny lalana (/path/to/file.txt). Ho an'ny fifandraisana tsy mitonona anarana dia ampiasao ny fidirana *anonymous* ary adiresy mailaka ho tenimiafina. Ny votoatin'ny rakitra no haverina."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try to download file specified in path (/path/to/file.txt) from TFTP server. The content of the file is returned."
msgstr "Andramo ny maka ny rakitra voafaritra ao amin'ny lalana (/path/to/file.txt) avy amin'ny mpizara TFTP. Averina ny votoatin'ny rakitra."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted SCP connection, login and try to download file specified in path (/path/to/file.txt)."
msgstr "Fifandraisana SCP voaaro amin'ny fanafenana, midira ary andramo ny maka ny rakitra voafaritra ao amin'ny lalana (/path/to/file.txt)."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try SMB protocol, username and password are required. Try to login and download file."
msgstr "Andramo ny protokoly SMB, ilaina ny anaran'ny mpampiasa sy ny tenimiafina. Andramo ny miditra sy maka rakitra."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Connect to MQTT server and listen for any message. You can specify topic in Path (bedroom/temp), blank for any topic. For this test is recommended increase \"Long duration alert\""
msgstr "Mifandraisa amin'ny mpizara MQTT ary mihainoa hafatra rehetra. Azonao atao ny mamaritra lohahevitra ao amin'ny Lalana (bedroom/temp), avelao ho banga ho an'ny lohahevitra rehetra. Ho an'ity fitsapana ity dia soso-kevitra ny mampitombo ny \"Fampandrenesana maharitra\""

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with basic HTTP auth. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Fitsapana REST API miaraka amin'ny fanamarinana HTTP tsotra. Omano aloha ny mombamomba ny fidirana."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with API key auth. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Fitsapana REST API miaraka amin'ny fanamarinana API key. Omano aloha ny mombamomba ny fidirana."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with Oauth2. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Fitsapana REST API miaraka amin'ny Oauth2. Omano aloha ny mombamomba ny fidirana."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with cookie auth. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Fitsapana REST API miaraka amin'ny fanamarinana cookie. Omano aloha ny mombamomba ny fidirana."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try SNMP get method. Output for specified OID is returned. Credential is required, you have to prepare SNMP v.1,2 or v3 credential first."
msgstr "Andramo ny fomba SNMP get. Averina ny valiny ho an'ny OID voafaritra. Ilaina ny fahazoan-dalana, tsy maintsy manomana fahazoan-dalana SNMP v.1,2 na v3 aloha ianao."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try SNMP walk method. Output for specified OID is returned. Credential is required, you have to prepare SNMP v.1,2 or v3 credential first."
msgstr "Andramo ny fomba SNMP walk. Averina ny valiny ho an'ny OID voafaritra. Ilaina ny fahazoan-dalana, tsy maintsy manomana fahazoan-dalana SNMP v.1,2 na v3 aloha ianao."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Use ssh and connect to remote host. After login run specified command and return output. Username and password or private key is possible."
msgstr "Ampiasao ny SSH ary mifandraisa amin'ny mpampiantrano lavitra. Rehefa tafiditra dia alefaso ny baiko voafaritra ary avereno ny vokatra. Azo ampiasaina ny anaran'ny mpampiasa sy tenimiafina na lakile manokana."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SFTP protocol on port 22, username and password and path are required. Try to do directory listing of path."
msgstr "Protokoly SFTP amin'ny seranana 22, takiana ny anaran'ny mpampiasa, ny tenimiafina ary ny lalana. Andramo ny mitanisa ny lahatahiry amin'ilay lalana."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "All fine. Proceed as usual."
msgstr "Tsara daholo. Tohizo toy ny mahazatra."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The URL you passed to libcurl used a protocol that this libcurl does not support. The support might be a compile-time option that you did not use, it can be a misspelled protocol string or just a protocol libcurl has no code for."
msgstr "Ny URL nampitainao tamin'ny libcurl dia nampiasa protokol izay tsy tohanan'ity libcurl ity. Mety ho safidy tamin'ny famoronana rindrankajy tsy nampiasainao ilay fanohanana, mety ho diso tsipelina ny anaran'ny protokol na protokol tsy misy kaody ao amin'ny libcurl fotsiny."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Early initialization code failed. This is likely to be an internal error or problem, or a resource problem where something fundamental could not get done at init time."
msgstr "Tsy nahomby ny kaody fanombohana mialoha. Azo inoana fa hadisoana na olana anatiny izany, na olana amin'ny loharano ka tsy nisy zavatra fototra tontosa tamin'ny fotoana fanombohana."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The URL was not properly formatted."
msgstr "Tsy voarafitra araka ny tokony ho izy ny URL."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A requested feature, protocol or option was not found built-in in this libcurl due to a build-time decision. This means that a feature or option was not enabled or explicitly disabled when libcurl was built and in order to get it to function you have to get a rebuilt libcurl."
msgstr "Tsy hita tafiditra tao amin'ity libcurl ity ny endri-javatra, arofenitra na safidy nangatahina noho ny fanapahan-kevitra tamin'ny fotoana fanamboarana azy. Midika izany fa tsy natao mavitrika na natao tsy mavitrika manokana ny endri-javatra na safidy iray fony namboarina ny libcurl, ka mba hampandehanana azy dia tsy maintsy maka libcurl namboarina vaovao ianao."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Could not resolve proxy. The given proxy host could not be resolved."
msgstr "Tsy afaka namaha ny adiresin'ny proxy. Tsy voavaha ny adiresin'ny mpampiantrano proxy nomena."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Could not resolve host. The given remote host was not resolved."
msgstr "Tsy afaka namaha ny adiresin'ny mpampiantrano. Tsy voavaha ny adiresin'ny mpampiantrano lavitra nomena."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to connect() to host or proxy."
msgstr "Tsy nahomby ny connect() tamin'ny mpampiantrano na proxy."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The server sent data libcurl could not parse. This error code was known as CURLE_FTP_WEIRD_SERVER_REPLY before 7.51.0."
msgstr "Nandefa angon-drakitra tsy voazavan'ny libcurl ny mpizara. Fantatra amin'ny anarana hoe CURLE_FTP_WEIRD_SERVER_REPLY ity kaody hadisoana ity talohan'ny 7.51.0."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "We were denied access to the resource given in the URL. For FTP, this occurs while trying to change to the remote directory."
msgstr "Nolavina ny fidirana amin'ny loharano nomena tao amin'ny URL. Ho an'ny FTP, mitranga izany rehefa manandrana manova ny lahatahiry lavitra."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "While waiting for the server to connect back when an active FTP session is used, an error code was sent over the control connection or similar."
msgstr "Teo am-piandrasana ny lohamilina hifandray miverina rehefa mampiasa fifandraisana FTP mavitrika, dia nisy kaody hadisoana nalefa tamin'ny fifandraisana fanaraha-maso na mitovitovy amin'izany."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "After having sent the FTP password to the server, libcurl expects a proper reply. This error code indicates that an unexpected code was returned."
msgstr "Rehefa avy nandefa ny Tenimiafina FTP tany amin'ny lohamilina, dia manantena valiny mety ny libcurl. Ity kaody diso ity dia manondro fa kaody tsy nampoizina no naverina."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "During an active FTP session while waiting for the server to connect, the CURLOPT_ACCEPTTIMEOUT_MS (or the internal default) timeout expired."
msgstr "Nandritra ny fivoriana FTP mavitrika raha niandry ny fifandraisan'ny mpizara, tapitra ny fe-potoana CURLOPT_ACCEPTTIMEOUT_MS (na ny fe-potoana anatiny)."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Libcurl failed to get a sensible result back from the server as a response to either a PASV or a EPSV command. The server is flawed."
msgstr "Tsy nahazo valiny azo antoka avy amin'ny lohamilina ny Libcurl ho valin'ny baiko PASV na EPSV. Misy lesoka ny lohamilina."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "FTP servers return a 227-line as a response to a PASV command. If libcurl fails to parse that line, this return code is passed back."
msgstr "Ny mpizara FTP dia mamerina andalana 227 ho valin'ny baiko PASV. Raha tsy mahavita mamakafaka io andalana io ny libcurl, dia averina ity kaody fiverenana ity."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An internal failure to lookup the host used for the new connection."
msgstr "Tsy fahombiazana anatiny teo am-pikarohana ny mpampiantrano nampiasaina ho an'ny fifandraisana vaovao."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A problem was detected in the HTTP2 framing layer. This is somewhat generic and can be one out of several problems, see the error buffer for details."
msgstr "Nisy olana hita teo amin'ny sosona fandrafetana HTTP2. Somary ankapobeny izany ary mety ho iray amin'ireo olana maromaro, jereo ny fitahirizana hadisoana raha mila antsipiriany."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Received an error when trying to set the transfer mode to binary or ASCII."
msgstr "Nahazo hadisoana raha nanandrana nametraka ny fomba famindrana ho binary na ASCII."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A file transfer was shorter or larger than expected. This happens when the server first reports an expected transfer size, and then delivers data that does not match the previously given size."
msgstr "Fohy kokoa na lehibe kokoa noho ny nandrasana ny famindrana rakitra. Mitranga izany rehefa milaza habe famindrana andrasana aloha ny lohamilina, avy eo manatitra angona tsy mifanaraka amin'ilay habe nomena teo aloha."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This was either a weird reply to a 'RETR' command or a zero byte transfer complete."
msgstr "Na valiny hafahafa tamin'ny baiko 'RETR' ity, na famindrana zero byte vita."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Obsolete Error"
msgstr "Fahadisoana lany andro"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Not used in modern versions."
msgstr "Tsy ampiasaina amin'ireo dikan-teny vaovao."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When sending custom \"QUOTE\" commands to the remote server, one of the commands returned an error code that was 400 or higher (for FTP) or otherwise indicated unsuccessful completion of the command."
msgstr "Rehefa nandefa baiko \"QUOTE\" manokana tany amin'ny lohamilina lavitra, dia namerina kaody hadisoana 400 na mihoatra (ho an'ny FTP) ny iray tamin'ireo baiko ireo na nanondro fa tsy nahomby ny fanatanterahana ilay baiko."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is returned if CURLOPT_FAILONERROR is set true and the HTTP server returns an error code that is >= 400."
msgstr "Izany dia averina raha toa ka natao ho marina (true) ny CURLOPT_FAILONERROR ary mamerina kaody hadisoana >= 400 ny mpizara HTTP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An error occurred when writing received data to a local file, or an error was returned to libcurl from a write callback."
msgstr "Nisy hadisoana nitranga teo am-panoratana ny angona voaray tao amin'ny rakitra eo an-toerana, na nisy hadisoana naverin'ny write callback tany amin'ny libcurl."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed starting the upload. For FTP, the server typically denied the STOR command. The error buffer usually contains the server's explanation for this."
msgstr "Tsy nahomby ny fanombohana ny fampakarana. Ho an'ny FTP, matetika nolavin'ny mpizara ny baiko STOR. Ny tahirin-tsoratra hadisoana dia matetika ahitana ny fanazavan'ny mpizara momba izany."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "There was a problem reading a local file or an error returned by the read callback."
msgstr "Nisy olana teo am-pamakiana rakitra eo an-toerana na nisy hadisoana naverin'ny fampandehanana famakiana."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A memory allocation request failed. This is serious badness and things are severely screwed up if this ever occurs."
msgstr "Tsy nahomby ny fangatahana fanokanana fitadidiana. Olana lehibe izany ary tena simba ny raharaha raha mitranga izany."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Operation timeout. The specified time-out period was reached according to the conditions."
msgstr "Tapitra ny fe-potoanan'ny asa. Tratry ny fe-potoana voatondro araka ny fepetra."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The FTP PORT command returned error. This mostly happens when you have not specified a good enough address for libcurl to use. See CURLOPT_FTPPORT."
msgstr "Namerina hadisoana ny baiko FTP PORT. Matetika izany no mitranga rehefa tsy nanondro adiresy tsara ampiasain'ny libcurl ianao. Jereo ny CURLOPT_FTPPORT."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The FTP REST command returned error. This should never happen if the server is sane."
msgstr "Namerina hadisoana ny baiko FTP REST. Tsy tokony hitranga mihitsy izany raha salama tsara ny mpizara."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The server does not support or accept range requests."
msgstr "Tsy manohana na tsy manaiky fangatahana elanelana ny mpizara."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is an odd error that mainly occurs due to internal confusion."
msgstr "Ity dia hadisoana hafahafa izay mitranga indrindra noho ny fifanjevoana anatiny."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A problem occurred somewhere in the SSL/TLS handshake. You really want the error buffer and read the message there as it pinpoints the problem slightly more. Could be certificates (file formats, paths, permissions), passwords, and others."
msgstr "Nisy olana nitranga teo amin'ny fifampiresahana SSL/TLS. Tena ilainao ny mijery ny fitahirizana hadisoana (error buffer) ary mamaky ny hafatra ao satria manondro mazava kokoa ny olana izany. Mety ho taratasy fanamarinana (endrika rakitra, lalana, alalana), tenimiafina, sy ny hafa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The download could not be resumed because the specified offset was out of the file boundary."
msgstr "Tsy azo notohizana ny fampidinana satria nivoaka ny fetran'ny rakitra ny elanelana (offset) voatondro."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A file given with FILE:// could not be opened. Most likely because the file path does not identify an existing file. Did you check file permissions?"
msgstr "Tsy azo nosokafana ny rakitra nomena tamin'ny FILE://. Mety ho noho ny lalan'ny rakitra tsy manondro rakitra misy izany. Efa nojerenao ve ny alalan'ny rakitra?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP cannot bind. LDAP bind operation failed."
msgstr "Tsy afaka mifamatotra ny LDAP. Tsy nahomby ny fampifandraisana LDAP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP search failed."
msgstr "Tsy nahomby ny fikarohana LDAP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Function not found. A required zlib function was not found."
msgstr "Tsy hita ny fiasa. Tsy hita ny fiasa zlib ilaina."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Aborted by callback. A callback returned \"abort\" to libcurl."
msgstr "Natsahatry ny callback. Nisy callback namerina \"abort\" tamin'ny libcurl."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A function was called with a bad parameter."
msgstr "Nantsoina tamin'ny masontsivana diso ny fiasa iray."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Interface error. A specified outgoing interface could not be used. Set which interface to use for outgoing connections' source IP address with URLOPT_INTERFACE."
msgstr "Hadisoana amin'ny fifandraisana. Tsy azo nampiasaina ny fifandraisana fivoahana voafaritra. Farito amin'ny alalan'ny URLOPT_INTERFACE izay fifandraisana hampiasaina ho an'ny adiresy IP loharanon'ny fifandraisana mivoaka."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Too many redirects. When following redirects, libcurl hit the maximum amount. Set your limit with CURLOPT_MAXREDIRS."
msgstr "Famerenana lalana (redirects) be loatra. Rehefa nanaraka ny famerenana lalana ny libcurl dia nahatratra ny fetra ambony indrindra. Apetraho amin'ny alalan'ny CURLOPT_MAXREDIRS ny fetranao."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An option passed to libcurl is not recognized/known. Refer to the appropriate documentation. This is most likely a problem in the program that uses libcurl. The error buffer might contain more specific information about which exact option it concerns."
msgstr "Tsy fantatra/tsy ekena ny safidy iray nalefa tany amin'ny libcurl. Jereo ny tahirin-kevitra mifanentana amin'izany. Mety ho olana ao amin'ny programa mampiasa libcurl izany. Mety misy fampahalalana mazava kokoa momba izay tena safidy voakasika ao amin'ny buffer-n'ny hadisoana."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An option passed in to a setopt was wrongly formatted. See error message for details about what option."
msgstr "Diso endrika ny safidy iray nampidirina tao amin'ny setopt. Jereo ny hafatra hadisoana raha mila antsipiriany momba izany safidy izany."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Nothing was returned from the server, and under the circumstances, getting nothing is considered an error."
msgstr "Tsy nisy naverin'ny lohamilina, ary amin'izao toe-javatra izao, ny tsy fahazoana na inona na inona dia raisina ho fahadisoana."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The specified crypto engine was not found."
msgstr "Tsy hita ilay milina fanafenana voatondro."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed setting the selected SSL crypto engine as default."
msgstr "Tsy nahomby ny fametrahana ny motera fanafenana SSL voafidy ho mahazatra."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed sending network data."
msgstr "Tsy nahomby ny fandefasana angona tambajotra."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failure with receiving network data."
msgstr "Tsy fahombiazana tamin'ny fandraisana angona tambajotra."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "problem with the local client certificate."
msgstr "olana amin'ny taratasy fanamarinana mpanjifa eo an-toerana."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Could not use specified cipher."
msgstr "Tsy afaka nampiasa ny fanafenana voafaritra."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The remote server's SSL certificate or SSH fingerprint was deemed not OK. This error code has been unified with CURLE_SSL_CACERT since 7.62.0. Its previous value was 51."
msgstr "Tsy nekena ho tsara ny taratasy fanamarinana SSL na ny dian-tanana SSH an'ny mpizara lavitra. Natambatra tamin'ny CURLE_SSL_CACERT ity kaody hadisoana ity hatramin'ny 7.62.0. Ny sandany teo aloha dia 51."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unrecognized transfer encoding."
msgstr "Fandikana famindrana tsy fantatra."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Maximum file size exceeded."
msgstr "Mihoatra ny haben'ny rakitra farany ambony."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Requested FTP SSL level failed."
msgstr "Tsy nahomby ny haavon'ny FTP SSL nangatahina."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When doing a send operation curl had to rewind the data to retransmit, but the rewinding operation failed."
msgstr "Rehefa nanao fandefasana ny curl dia tsy maintsy naverina tany am-piandohana ny angona mba halefa indray, saingy tsy nahomby ny famerenana azy."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Initiating the SSL Engine failed."
msgstr "Tsy nahomby ny fanombohana ny maotera SSL."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The remote server denied curl to login (Added in 7.13.1)"
msgstr "Nandà ny fidiran'ny curl ny mpizara lavitra (Nampiana tamin'ny 7.13.1)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "File not found on TFTP server."
msgstr "Tsy hita tao amin'ny mpizara TFTP ny rakitra."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Permission problem on TFTP server."
msgstr "Olana amin'ny fahazoan-dalana ao amin'ny lohamilina TFTP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Out of disk space on the server."
msgstr "Tsy ampy ny toerana ao amin'ny kapila ao amin'ny mpizara."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Illegal TFTP operation."
msgstr "Hetsika TFTP tsy ara-dalàna."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unknown TFTP transfer ID."
msgstr "ID famindrana TFTP tsy fantatra."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "File already exists and is not overwritten."
msgstr "Efa misy ny rakitra ary tsy nosoloina."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This error should never be returned by a properly functioning TFTP server."
msgstr "Tsy tokony haverin'ny mpizara TFTP miasa tsara mihitsy ity hadisoana ity."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Problem with reading the SSL CA cert (path? access rights?)"
msgstr "Olana teo am-pamakiana ny taratasy fanamarinana SSL CA (lalana? alalana miditra?)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The resource referenced in the URL does not exist."
msgstr "Tsy misy ny loharano voatondro ao amin'ny URL."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An unspecified error occurred during the SSH session."
msgstr "Nisy hadisoana tsy voafaritra nitranga nandritra ny fotoam-pivoriana SSH."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to shut down the SSL connection."
msgstr "Tsy nahomby ny fanakatonana ny fifandraisana SSL."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Socket is not ready for send/recv wait till it's ready and try again. This return code is only returned from curl_easy_recv and curl_easy_send (Added in 7.18.2)"
msgstr "Tsy mbola vonona handefa na handray ny socket, andraso mandra-pahavonony ary andramo indray. Ity kaody fiverenana ity dia avy amin'ny curl_easy_recv sy curl_easy_send ihany no miverina (Nampiana tao amin'ny 7.18.2)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to load CRL file (Added in 7.19.0)"
msgstr "Tsy nahomby ny fampidirana ny rakitra CRL (Nampiana tamin'ny 7.19.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Issuer check failed (Added in 7.19.0)"
msgstr "Tsy nahomby ny fanamarinana ny mpamoaka (Nampiana tamin'ny 7.19.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The FTP server does not understand the PRET command at all or does not support the given argument. Be careful when using CURLOPT_CUSTOMREQUEST, a custom LIST command is sent with the PRET command before PASV as well. (Added in 7.20.0)"
msgstr "Tsy mahazo mihitsy ny baiko PRET ny mpizara FTP na tsy manohana ny hevitra nomena. Mitandrema rehefa mampiasa CURLOPT_CUSTOMREQUEST, satria alefa miaraka amin'ny baiko PRET alohan'ny PASV ihany koa ny baiko LIST manokana. (Nampiana tamin'ny 7.20.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Mismatch of RTSP CSeq numbers."
msgstr "Tsy mifanaraka ny laharan'ny RTSP CSeq."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Mismatch of RTSP Session Identifiers."
msgstr "Tsy mifanaraka ny famantarana ny fivoriana RTSP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unable to parse FTP file list (during FTP wildcard downloading)."
msgstr "Tsy afaka manadihady ny lisitry ny rakitra FTP (mandritra ny fampidinana FTP misy wildcard)."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Chunk callback reported error."
msgstr "Nitatitra hadisoana ny chunk callback."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "(For internal use only, is never returned by libcurl) No connection available, the session is queued. (added in 7.30.0)"
msgstr "(Ho an'ny fampiasana anatiny ihany, tsy averin'ny libcurl mihitsy) Tsy misy fifandraisana azo ampiasaina, napetraka amin'ny filaharana ny sesiona. (nampiana tamin'ny 7.30.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to match the pinned key specified with CURLOPT_PINNEDPUBLICKEY."
msgstr "Tsy nifanaraka tamin'ny fanalahidy voafantsika voalaza amin'ny CURLOPT_PINNEDPUBLICKEY."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Status returned failure when asked with CURLOPT_SSL_VERIFYSTATUS."
msgstr "Namerina tsy fahombiazana ny sata rehefa nanontaniana tamin'ny CURLOPT_SSL_VERIFYSTATUS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Stream error in the HTTP/2 framing layer."
msgstr "Hadisoan'ny fikorianana ao amin'ny sosona fandrafetana HTTP/2."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An API function was called from inside a callback."
msgstr "Nisy asa API nantsoina avy tao anaty callback."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An authentication function returned an error."
msgstr "Namerina hadisoana ny asa fanamarinana ny maha-izy azy."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A problem was detected in the HTTP/3 layer. This is somewhat generic and can be one out of several problems, see the error buffer for details."
msgstr "Nisy olana hita teo amin'ny sosona HTTP/3. Somary ankapobeny izany ary mety ho iray amin'ireo olana maromaro, jereo ny fitahirizana hadisoana raha mila antsipiriany."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "QUIC connection error. This error may be caused by an SSL library error. QUIC is the protocol used for HTTP/3 transfers."
msgstr "Hadisoana tamin'ny fifandraisana QUIC. Mety ho avy amin'ny hadisoan'ny tranomboky SSL io hadisoana io. Ny QUIC no protokoly ampiasaina amin'ny fifindrana HTTP/3."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Proxy handshake error. CURLINFO_PROXY_ERROR provides extra details on the specific problem."
msgstr "Hadisoana teo amin'ny fifanarahana voalohany amin'ny Proxy. Manome antsipiriany fanampiny momba ilay olana manokana ny CURLINFO_PROXY_ERROR."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSL Client Certificate required."
msgstr "Takiana ny taratasy fanamarinana SSL an'ny mpanjifa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An internal call to poll() or select() returned error that is not recoverable."
msgstr "Namerina hadisoana tsy azo arenina ny fiantsoana anatiny ny poll() na select()."

