msgid "The User-Agent string sent with HTTP/HTTPS and other cURL based service checks. Some sites block old or uncommon browsers, so you can set a current User-Agent here. Leave blank to use the built-in default."
msgstr "Ny lahatsoratra User-Agent alefa miaraka amin'ny HTTP/HTTPS sy ny fanamarinana tolotra hafa mifototra amin'ny cURL. Ny toerana sasany dia manakana mpitety tranonkala taloha na tsy fahita firy, ka azonao atao ny mametraka User-Agent vaovao eto. Avelao ho banga raha hampiasa ny sanda voafaritra mialoha ao anatiny."

